{"name": "GraveFeast", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIGHT OR DIE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hero set out to slay the Demon Lord. He returned cursed. His life bleeds away with every heartbeat, and his body craves blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most action games teach you to retreat when your health runs low. GraveFeast teaches you the opposite. The curse doesn't care how carefully you play. The only way to live is to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/b0d85e72be84941d61944d9f300f8f12.poster.avif?t=1791558187\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/b0d85e72be84941d61944d9f300f8f12.webm?t=1791558187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/b0d85e72be84941d61944d9f300f8f12.mp4?t=1791558187\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GATHER. SLAUGHTER. FEAST.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't fight enemies one at a time. Pull them into a single mass, then wipe them out together for a massive surge of stolen life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather Drag</strong> <br/>scattered enemies into one killing ground</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rush</strong> <br/>Charge forward, dragging foes along with you</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Execute</strong><br/>Narrow, devastating strikes with heavy lifesteal</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Screen</strong> <br/>Clear Erase everything you've gathered at once</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/392893f797aa84ca257ee75f7a3c87fd.poster.avif?t=1791558187\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/392893f797aa84ca257ee75f7a3c87fd.webm?t=1791558187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/392893f797aa84ca257ee75f7a3c87fd.mp4?t=1791558187\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BLOOD RAGE &amp; OVERBLOOD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop below a threshold and the berserker awakens. Attack speed, movement, and lifesteal all surge. You are most dangerous when you are closest to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed well enough and your health climbs past its own limit. Overblood grants further power, but it bleeds away fast. Keep the cycle going or lose it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/f05187add438c38e8dce6ad974d6111f.poster.avif?t=1791558187\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/f05187add438c38e8dce6ad974d6111f.webm?t=1791558187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/f05187add438c38e8dce6ad974d6111f.mp4?t=1791558187\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR CURSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a chance to try a skill you haven\u2019t used yet.<br/>The demo features the Dark Knight only. More fighters await in the full game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark Knight:</strong> Blood-soaked blade, balanced fury</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assassin:</strong> Fast, fragile, silent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rakshasa:</strong> Pure destructive temper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inquisitor:</strong> Holy fire, no mercy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/426164cb54daea94b3d079b58c795bb1.poster.avif?t=1791558187\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/426164cb54daea94b3d079b58c795bb1.webm?t=1791558187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/extras/426164cb54daea94b3d079b58c795bb1.mp4?t=1791558187\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HAND-DRAWN CARNAGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every frame is drawn by hand. Ash-choked skies, fields of impaled bone, and blood that floods the screen when the slaughter peaks.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "The curse drains your life with every passing second. The only cure is blood. Charge into the horde, gather them, and tear them apart to drink deep. In GraveFeast, low health isn't a reason to run. It's a reason to go deeper.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5187180/fb55b3f44dca0b10db3673a1b12d01b360fe0fb3/header.jpg?t=1791558187", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Hack and Slash", "Action", "Dark Fantasy", "2D", "Side Scroller", "Beat 'em up"], "developers": "IDIOCRACY, INC", "publishers": "IDIOCRACY, INC", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5187180", "review